WEBVTT

01:41.360 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.500 --> 01:48.890
[Episode 31]

01:49.430 --> 01:50.120
Now, tell me,

01:50.710 --> 01:51.759
what exactly happened to Mu Qingge?

01:52.070 --> 01:52.789
Otherwise,

01:53.310 --> 01:54.509
you two wouldn't need to stay here.

01:56.509 --> 01:57.759
We dare not hide the truth.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.510
Mu Qingge indeed died once.

02:00.790 --> 02:01.400
However,

02:01.420 --> 02:02.840
you had her reincarnated and revived,

02:03.680 --> 02:05.040
and you placed a restriction on her appearance,

02:05.230 --> 02:06.510
making her unrecognizable to everyone.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.310
What?

02:07.910 --> 02:09.520
Guardian, please let me explain everything.

02:15.490 --> 02:17.190
Out of consideration for my bond with that demoness—

02:17.190 --> 02:18.030
master and disciple—

02:18.430 --> 02:20.280
I used a half of my Golden Core to revive her?

02:22.630 --> 02:23.960
Going to the netherworld to seal the Spirit Spring

02:23.960 --> 02:24.960
was also something she entrusted me with?

02:25.800 --> 02:26.960
Are you kidding me?

02:27.470 --> 02:28.590
Every word I said was true.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.310
Then what about Xue Ranran?

02:30.710 --> 02:31.870
What does she have to do

02:31.870 --> 02:32.680
with me reviving Mu Qingge?

02:32.870 --> 02:33.520
Why does she carry

02:33.520 --> 02:34.430
the energy of my Golden Core?

02:35.840 --> 02:37.030
Actually...

02:38.000 --> 02:39.360
there were two fruits

02:39.430 --> 02:40.560
on the Reincarnation Tree.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.240
Besides Mu Qingge,

02:43.630 --> 02:44.840
the other one was Mu Ranwu.

02:46.360 --> 02:48.190
Xue Ranran...

02:48.750 --> 02:50.470
Though her appearance is different from her past life,

02:50.840 --> 02:51.870
she is Mu Ranwu.

02:55.910 --> 02:56.360
Yes!

02:56.520 --> 02:58.470
Xue Ranran is Mu Ranwu.

02:58.680 --> 03:00.280
She accidentally

03:00.280 --> 03:01.190
perished with Mu Qingge

03:01.310 --> 03:02.400
back then.

03:02.800 --> 03:04.280
When you activated the Reincarnation Tree,

03:04.430 --> 03:05.680
you saved her as well.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.360
Your Golden Core just so

03:07.360 --> 03:07.960
happened to enter her body.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.360
Mu Ranwu?

03:10.280 --> 03:10.840
Alright.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.120
Since she's that

03:12.120 --> 03:13.280
two-faced woman,

03:13.750 --> 03:15.030
I don't need to hold back anymore.

03:15.400 --> 03:16.190
Just kill her.

03:17.780 --> 03:18.840
G-Guardian, you can't do that!

03:18.870 --> 03:19.710
Why not?

03:19.840 --> 03:20.630
You... you...

03:20.800 --> 03:22.400
Since her...

03:22.710 --> 03:23.710
reincarnation,

03:23.870 --> 03:25.120
you've fallen in love with her.

03:25.750 --> 03:27.000
Are you out of your minds?

03:27.520 --> 03:28.870
Everything I say is true.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.560
I can make a soul oath

03:31.120 --> 03:32.520
that you really like Xue Ranran.

03:33.120 --> 03:34.560
You personally brought her to Mount Wester

03:34.750 --> 03:35.670
and treated her with great care.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.970
You even risked your own life

03:38.000 --> 03:38.710
to protect her.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.430
Everyone on Mount Wester knows it,

03:40.710 --> 03:42.280
and many in the Heavenly Sects have seen it.

03:42.560 --> 03:43.470
Guardian, you can ask around.

03:48.030 --> 03:49.400
Even if it was true in the past,

03:50.000 --> 03:51.360
it has nothing to do with the present me.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.400
I would never make

03:52.430 --> 03:53.750
the weak mistake of falling in love,

03:54.079 --> 03:55.240
especially not with Mu Ranwu.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.190
I suppose the reason

03:57.210 --> 03:58.490
I haven't ascended in the past 20 years

03:58.520 --> 03:59.430
might be because of her.

04:00.240 --> 04:00.710
Alright.

04:01.560 --> 04:02.630
I'm going to kill her now

04:03.150 --> 04:04.000
and take out the Golden Core,

04:04.430 --> 04:05.710
so that she won't disturb my cultivation.

04:06.910 --> 04:07.560
Guardian!

04:07.910 --> 04:08.470
Step aside.

04:21.510 --> 04:22.190
Wu,

04:23.160 --> 04:24.310
why are you here?

04:26.360 --> 04:27.240
Please forgive me, Sir.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.000
Since we were in the netherworld,

04:29.560 --> 04:30.830
I've wanted to speak with you,

04:31.600 --> 04:33.240
but never had the chance.

04:33.480 --> 04:34.390
That's why...

04:35.630 --> 04:37.159
Why have you started calling me "Sir"?

04:38.600 --> 04:39.390
Uncle Ye Xin.

04:40.430 --> 04:41.240
That's more like it.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.510
If there's anything you want to ask me,

04:43.700 --> 04:44.670
feel free to ask.

04:46.360 --> 04:48.360
In my past life, someone gave me a Soul-Devouring Lock.

04:49.390 --> 04:50.360
That was me.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.720
So, from the moment

04:52.720 --> 04:53.720
you took us in,

04:54.440 --> 04:55.920
you had already planned for what would come next?

04:58.310 --> 04:59.120
Wu,

04:59.630 --> 05:00.560
as you know,

05:01.190 --> 05:02.480
I really cared for you

05:02.600 --> 05:03.750
and your sister.

05:04.750 --> 05:05.680
It's just a pity

05:06.830 --> 05:08.470
that your sister's talent was too high—

05:09.040 --> 05:09.830
so high

05:10.040 --> 05:11.070
that it became a hindrance.

05:12.390 --> 05:13.720
So I used you

05:14.000 --> 05:15.070
to eliminate her.

05:16.870 --> 05:17.630
You're not happy about it?

05:19.160 --> 05:19.720
No.

05:20.520 --> 05:21.120
I'm not.

05:21.390 --> 05:21.950
Of course not.

05:22.400 --> 05:24.090
That was also your desire.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.040
You took your sister's

05:35.040 --> 05:36.310
spiritual power and Spirit Root,

05:36.630 --> 05:39.310
but your cultivation declined instead of rising.

05:39.630 --> 05:41.390
You're indeed not suited for the Heavenly Sects.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.510
However,

05:44.200 --> 05:45.010
considering that you helped me

05:45.040 --> 05:46.480
escape the netherworld,

05:47.159 --> 05:48.560
I should repay your kindness.

05:49.450 --> 05:50.570
I'll help you remove the scar

05:50.740 --> 05:52.300
that you care about the most.

05:53.510 --> 05:54.120
Also,

05:54.870 --> 05:55.720
do you still want to

05:55.750 --> 05:57.120
be above your sister?

05:58.240 --> 05:59.630
Uncle Ye Xin, can you help me?

06:01.510 --> 06:02.870
I'll teach you some

06:03.120 --> 06:04.800
special cultivation methods.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.630
As long as you obediently

06:07.200 --> 06:08.640
do what I told you to do,

06:09.100 --> 06:11.100
I promise you'll get what you want.

06:36.159 --> 06:36.830
Master,

06:37.720 --> 06:38.600
I made some elixirs

06:38.600 --> 06:39.680
and was about to bring them to you.

06:40.190 --> 06:41.390
You still have some injuries.

06:41.750 --> 06:43.270
These elixirs should be very effective.

06:44.750 --> 06:46.159
So you're Mu Ranwu.

06:50.950 --> 06:52.480
Yu Tong and Yu Chen told me

06:53.159 --> 06:54.190
that I've fallen in love with you.

06:55.070 --> 06:56.480
That's absolute nonsense.

06:58.040 --> 06:59.310
It seems that my two uncle masters

06:59.630 --> 07:00.920
are helping me cover up my identity.

07:01.870 --> 07:02.870
The most boring thing in the world

07:02.870 --> 07:04.070
is those lovesick men and women

07:04.800 --> 07:05.920
clinging to each other through life and death.

07:06.600 --> 07:07.480
How could I be one of those

07:07.480 --> 07:08.510
who indulge in love and romance?

07:13.830 --> 07:14.430
Tell me.

07:15.630 --> 07:16.750
What is your true intention

07:16.920 --> 07:18.120
in being by my side?

07:21.160 --> 07:22.630
What intention could I have?

07:23.120 --> 07:24.040
My only intention

07:24.040 --> 07:25.360
is you, Master.

07:28.120 --> 07:29.390
It's just that you've forgotten.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.240
We've long made an oath

07:31.270 --> 07:32.430
to never part

07:32.870 --> 07:34.120
and have confessed our true feelings to each other.

07:34.830 --> 07:35.920
To save me

07:36.120 --> 07:36.680
and protect me,

07:36.830 --> 07:38.120
you brought me to Mount Wester.

07:41.120 --> 07:41.680
Look,

07:42.310 --> 07:43.040
this tree.

07:43.750 --> 07:45.190
We planted it together

07:45.310 --> 07:46.600
shortly after I came to Mount Wester.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.070
You said that

07:49.920 --> 07:50.720
with a tree,

07:51.120 --> 07:51.920
we had roots,

07:52.630 --> 07:53.680
and with roots, we had a home.

07:56.390 --> 07:57.390
Along the way,

07:57.920 --> 07:58.720
you almost lost your life

07:58.750 --> 08:00.120
just to protect me.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.630
But you

08:02.630 --> 08:03.800
have forgotten all of this.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.310
You don't need to put on

08:08.310 --> 08:09.510
this pitiful face

08:09.510 --> 08:10.310
to deceive me.

08:10.950 --> 08:12.000
You're the younger sister

08:12.000 --> 08:12.920
of that demoness Mu Qingge.

08:13.530 --> 08:14.450
I remember seeing you once or twice

08:14.480 --> 08:15.310
in the Wester Sect.

08:25.950 --> 08:27.190
Even if I did fall in love with someone,

08:28.390 --> 08:29.510
what about you

08:30.000 --> 08:31.360
would make me fall for you?

08:34.720 --> 08:35.750
What about me?

08:40.980 --> 08:42.530
Since you don't remember,

08:43.940 --> 08:45.450
I'll help you.

08:59.870 --> 09:01.030
Do you remember now?

09:01.520 --> 09:03.030
How dare you do this to me?

09:04.960 --> 09:05.480
Do you believe

09:05.480 --> 09:06.200
I will kill you right now

09:06.200 --> 09:07.120
and take back my Golden Core?

09:08.550 --> 09:10.360
The Golden Core inside me is indeed yours.

09:11.270 --> 09:12.600
If you remembered everything

09:13.080 --> 09:14.080
and wanted me to return the Golden Core,

09:14.080 --> 09:15.030
I wouldn't say a word.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.550
But what is this now?

09:23.150 --> 09:24.820
Are you really going to kill me?

09:27.720 --> 09:28.240
Shui.

09:28.600 --> 09:29.240
Master.

09:30.380 --> 09:30.970
Master.

09:31.390 --> 09:32.080
Su Yishui.

09:47.510 --> 09:48.030
Master!

09:48.220 --> 09:48.690
Get away!

09:49.390 --> 09:49.910
Stay away from me!

09:50.000 --> 09:50.600
Su Yishui,

09:50.720 --> 09:51.720
have these past 10 years been for nothing

09:51.720 --> 09:52.080
to you?

09:52.600 --> 09:53.630
You've turned back into that brat,

09:53.630 --> 09:54.030
haven't you?

09:54.550 --> 09:55.390
Let me tell you,

09:55.730 --> 09:56.520
if you dare

09:56.550 --> 09:57.550
lay even a finger on Ranran,

09:57.840 --> 09:59.000
I will gather all our brothers

09:59.020 --> 09:59.950
to fight you to the death!

10:21.600 --> 10:22.080
Oh no.

10:22.600 --> 10:23.840
Ranran's spiritual power is almost depleted.

10:24.360 --> 10:25.600
With the Soul-Devouring Lock devouring her,

10:26.150 --> 10:27.270
I'm afraid her primal power might dry up.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.600
Are you alright?

10:56.510 --> 10:58.120
The one casting the spell is working for Mu Qingge.

11:00.790 --> 11:01.910
She's trying to steal your spiritual power?

11:07.480 --> 11:08.150
Yes.

11:14.270 --> 11:15.870
I've stabilized the spiritual power inside you.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.630
You won't be in danger for now.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.030
Thank you, Master.

11:21.870 --> 11:22.480
I just don't want

11:22.480 --> 11:23.600
your spiritual power to be drained,

11:23.750 --> 11:24.720
damaging my Golden Core.

11:25.480 --> 11:26.390
And for some reason,

11:27.000 --> 11:28.320
whenever I try to take your Golden Core,

11:28.470 --> 11:29.630
my head starts buzzing.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.870
Anyway, you can't escape my grasp.

11:31.870 --> 11:32.910
I won't kill you for now.

11:33.720 --> 11:34.670
Take her away

11:34.790 --> 11:35.270
and watch her closely.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.600
Don't let her appear before me again

11:37.910 --> 11:39.360
before I sort out these matters.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.270
Also, drive my three stupid disciples

11:41.270 --> 11:41.960
off the mountain.

11:42.670 --> 11:43.200
Yes.

11:57.390 --> 11:58.320
Su Yishui?

11:58.700 --> 11:59.950
He now actually

12:00.150 --> 12:01.910
has the ability to break my spell.

12:02.550 --> 12:04.030
Now, Mu Qingge only has

12:04.630 --> 12:05.840
a little spiritual power left.

12:06.910 --> 12:08.750
She used her Formless Spirit Root as a sacrifice

12:09.560 --> 12:10.970
and returned Su Yishui's spiritual soul

12:11.000 --> 12:12.000
to him.

12:12.510 --> 12:14.670
As expected of something Mu Qingge would do.

12:15.930 --> 12:16.800
However,

12:17.310 --> 12:18.880
your spiritual power is enough now.

12:19.420 --> 12:20.600
Continue cultivating with the method

12:20.630 --> 12:21.360
I taught you.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.200
When I need you,

12:23.630 --> 12:24.670
I will come to call you.

12:38.270 --> 12:39.870
This is the Fanyao battlefield?

12:41.830 --> 12:43.030
Yu Chen said I entered the netherworld

12:43.030 --> 12:44.720
and sealed the Spirit Spring from here.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.440
The Supreme Blood Moon

12:51.440 --> 12:52.550
appears with the blood.

12:54.320 --> 12:55.240
The malicious energy on this battlefield

12:55.240 --> 12:56.270
has already been exhausted.

12:58.370 --> 12:59.130
The Blood Moon

12:59.550 --> 13:01.000
will not appear for now.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.120
I can only wait for the right time

13:04.860 --> 13:06.650
and enter the netherworld with the secret key.

13:10.750 --> 13:11.360
They said that

13:11.360 --> 13:13.240
it was someone named Ye Xin who made me lose my memory.

13:20.050 --> 13:21.680
Who exactly is this person,

13:21.960 --> 13:22.960
and what is their purpose?

13:24.120 --> 13:24.960
Yu Chen discovered

13:24.960 --> 13:25.840
that he had appeared in the capital city.

13:31.750 --> 13:32.430
So,

13:33.150 --> 13:34.790
you really are Mu.

13:37.000 --> 13:37.750
Great.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.750
Liang used to always tell me

13:39.870 --> 13:41.200
you resembled Mu,

13:41.550 --> 13:42.320
but I never believed it.

13:44.250 --> 13:45.250
Good, good.

13:45.660 --> 13:46.350
This is wonderful.

13:47.270 --> 13:48.240
I can finally get to drink

13:48.270 --> 13:49.870
Mu's Mistaken Divine again.

13:50.630 --> 13:51.480
Alright.

13:51.910 --> 13:52.950
You finally saw Qingge again,

13:53.270 --> 13:54.240
and all you can think about is drinking?

13:56.070 --> 13:56.860
Thank you, guys.

13:57.390 --> 13:58.630
Although I only have

13:58.710 --> 13:59.870
a faint memory of the past,

14:00.510 --> 14:01.720
whether it's before

14:01.960 --> 14:02.600
or now,

14:03.030 --> 14:04.480
you're always my best friends.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.120
I'm glad to see you

14:06.320 --> 14:07.030
like this now.

14:07.160 --> 14:07.950
I'm really happy.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.120
Happy?

14:10.000 --> 14:10.910
That brat Su Yishui

14:10.910 --> 14:12.000
is out of control now.

14:12.280 --> 14:13.350
He's even deceiving us

14:13.630 --> 14:14.150
and being the master

14:14.150 --> 14:15.390
of his own master.

14:16.720 --> 14:17.510
What a twisted fate.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.360
You two really have a twisted fate.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.360
Mu,

14:21.910 --> 14:23.480
how should I persuade you?

14:24.200 --> 14:25.750
There's no such thing as twisted fate or good fate

14:25.820 --> 14:26.580
in this world.

14:27.150 --> 14:27.870
All fates

14:27.870 --> 14:28.550
are created by ourselves,

14:28.550 --> 14:29.440
right?

14:30.120 --> 14:31.550
No matter what the current situation is,

14:31.870 --> 14:32.790
I should find a way

14:32.810 --> 14:33.900
to break through it, right?

14:37.320 --> 14:38.420
Have you found any clues

14:38.450 --> 14:39.640
about the talisman made by the Falling Water

14:39.790 --> 14:40.790
I asked you to investigate?

14:41.910 --> 14:42.910
The talisman that was cast

14:43.470 --> 14:45.560
on Su Yishui should be a Soul-Cleansing Charm.

14:47.440 --> 14:48.750
This talisman washes away

14:49.210 --> 14:50.810
all memories after a person

14:50.840 --> 14:51.720
has experienced love,

14:52.460 --> 14:54.220
causing them to return to how they were before.

14:56.870 --> 14:58.240
No wonder he only remembers

14:58.510 --> 15:00.550
when he first arrived at Mount Wester and hated his master the most,

15:00.920 --> 15:01.970
turning back into that brat

15:02.000 --> 15:03.320
who didn't understand love.

15:04.290 --> 15:05.370
So, how can we undo

15:05.630 --> 15:06.750
this Soul-Cleansing Charm?

15:08.640 --> 15:09.210
Even you,

15:09.240 --> 15:10.590
one of the best talismanic cultivators in the universe,

15:10.720 --> 15:11.870
can't do anything about it?

15:13.670 --> 15:14.320
The Soul-Cleansing Charm

15:14.320 --> 15:15.960
cast on Su Yishui was made from Falling Water

15:16.170 --> 15:17.540
from the netherworld.

15:18.320 --> 15:19.910
Though I'm skilled in talismans,

15:20.030 --> 15:21.980
I am just a mortal after all.

15:22.740 --> 15:23.740
I am powerless against things

15:23.810 --> 15:25.260
from the netherworld.

15:26.530 --> 15:28.100
If it can't truly be undone,

15:28.910 --> 15:30.150
does that mean he really will never remember me

15:30.150 --> 15:31.270
for the rest of his life?

15:33.060 --> 15:35.490
This Soul-Cleansing Charm was cast by Ye Xin.

15:36.000 --> 15:36.870
Since he has the ability

15:36.870 --> 15:38.120
to mobilize the Falling Water from the netherworld,

15:38.630 --> 15:39.600
does he also have the power to undo

15:39.630 --> 15:40.720
this Soul-Cleansing Charm?

15:41.240 --> 15:42.630
We've been wondering about the background

15:42.650 --> 15:43.800
of this person

15:44.200 --> 15:45.440
who has such profound skills,

15:45.990 --> 15:47.350
yet we found no leads at all.

15:48.680 --> 15:49.770
I don't understand

15:50.270 --> 15:52.080
what Uncle Ye Xin intends to do either.

15:53.750 --> 15:54.510
Back then, he adopted me

15:54.530 --> 15:55.840
and my sister Mu Ranwu.

15:56.720 --> 15:57.550
From the bits of memories

15:57.570 --> 15:58.740
I can recall,

15:59.390 --> 16:01.270
he truly treated us well.

16:02.310 --> 16:03.400
But I also remember

16:04.510 --> 16:05.670
that when I tried to seal the Spirit Spring

16:05.670 --> 16:06.600
back into the netherworld,

16:07.320 --> 16:08.440
he stopped me

16:08.750 --> 16:09.550
and severely injured me.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.120
That was why I used

16:11.140 --> 16:11.820
the talisman that Alcohol Immortal gave me

16:12.000 --> 16:13.150
to seal him with all my strength.

16:13.360 --> 16:14.880
But why did he want to seize the Spirit Spring?

16:16.110 --> 16:17.630
And now, what are his intentions

16:17.910 --> 16:19.270
in placing this Soul-Cleansing Charm?

16:20.000 --> 16:21.150
Aside from sealing him,

16:21.550 --> 16:22.480
how much of the past

16:22.720 --> 16:23.840
do you remember?

16:27.440 --> 16:28.600
We can only wait and see

16:28.600 --> 16:29.360
what his next move will be.

16:29.750 --> 16:31.320
I'll send a letter to Elder Wen

16:31.720 --> 16:32.670
and see if he can find any leads

16:32.670 --> 16:33.720
on Uncle Ye Xin.

16:34.550 --> 16:35.440
If not,

16:35.940 --> 16:37.610
at least he can remind all the sects to be on guard.

16:38.150 --> 16:38.630
Okay.

16:39.000 --> 16:40.320
After Liang and I return to Mount Cuiwei,

16:40.320 --> 16:41.270
we'll try to come up with a plan.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.240
Thank you.

16:43.750 --> 16:44.270
Don't mention it.

17:06.150 --> 17:07.920
Didn't we agree

17:08.550 --> 17:10.550
to travel the Nine Lands together

17:11.060 --> 17:12.500
and taste all the delicacies of the world?

17:14.440 --> 17:15.750
Why do these things

17:17.550 --> 17:19.160
feel like they happened just yesterday,

17:21.119 --> 17:21.839
but in the blink of an eye,

17:22.680 --> 17:24.880
everything has turned out like this?

17:45.070 --> 17:45.790
Can't sleep?

17:48.160 --> 17:48.640
Come on.

17:49.310 --> 17:50.200
I'll drink with you for a while.

18:03.030 --> 18:03.720
To be honest,

18:05.070 --> 18:06.240
the year you perished,

18:06.790 --> 18:08.310
I hated Su Yishui deeply.

18:09.680 --> 18:10.640
Even though later I learned

18:10.640 --> 18:11.590
he was deceived,

18:12.070 --> 18:13.350
and he was more devastated and regretful

18:13.640 --> 18:14.160
than anyone else,

18:14.830 --> 18:15.790
I still resented him.

18:16.550 --> 18:17.160
All these years,

18:17.160 --> 18:18.550
I've never shown him a kind face.

18:22.000 --> 18:22.750
However,

18:23.480 --> 18:24.310
come to think of it,

18:25.440 --> 18:26.790
I also saw with my own eyes

18:26.790 --> 18:27.510
how that brat looked that year—

18:28.350 --> 18:29.720
withered,

18:30.200 --> 18:31.410
frantically searching for a way

18:31.440 --> 18:32.200
to revive you.

18:35.640 --> 18:36.350
Though I resented him,

18:37.360 --> 18:38.690
I knew how much

18:38.720 --> 18:40.070
he had sacrificed.

18:42.640 --> 18:44.240
No one expected that when you were revived,

18:44.350 --> 18:45.590
you'd lose your previous memories.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.240
Now,

18:47.820 --> 18:49.230
he's forgotten everything.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.960
It's as if everything—the past, the grudges, the affections—

18:53.960 --> 18:55.200
has been settled.

18:56.350 --> 18:57.550
The Spirit Spring has returned to its place,

18:58.270 --> 18:59.610
and both the human realm and netherworld

18:59.640 --> 19:00.550
have returned to peace.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.070
It's as if everything

19:02.070 --> 19:03.030
has gone back to the starting point.

19:04.070 --> 19:05.020
So, I suggest

19:06.210 --> 19:07.080
that the two of you might as well

19:07.110 --> 19:08.310
take this opportunity

19:09.400 --> 19:10.310
to end everything,

19:11.310 --> 19:12.200
part ways,

19:13.270 --> 19:14.240
and live your separate lives in peace.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.220
Oh, Master,

19:20.070 --> 19:21.550
my villa on Tea Inscription Mountain

19:21.570 --> 19:22.760
was originally prepared for you.

19:23.590 --> 19:24.510
You should go there.

19:24.920 --> 19:25.880
You can do whatever you want,

19:26.640 --> 19:27.440
without dwelling on the past,

19:28.000 --> 19:29.440
and live a happy life.

19:30.590 --> 19:31.640
If I don't dwell on the past,

19:32.200 --> 19:33.110
does that mean it's not there anymore?

19:35.880 --> 19:37.000
Liang Wumeng once said that

19:37.830 --> 19:39.440
this was the fate between him and me.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.750
But I don't believe in fate.

19:42.640 --> 19:43.720
I don't believe that all that happened

19:43.720 --> 19:44.550
over the past twenty-odd years,

19:44.920 --> 19:46.240
from Mu Qingge to Xue Ranran,

19:46.680 --> 19:47.480
hasn't left any traces

19:47.480 --> 19:48.590
in his heart.

19:50.240 --> 19:52.070
I don't believe he is still just the same young man

19:52.480 --> 19:54.240
full of malicious energy from back then.

19:56.400 --> 19:56.920
Ranran,

19:57.070 --> 19:57.510
you...

20:04.400 --> 20:05.510
I won't give up on him.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.350
I will definitely help him remember everything.

20:14.750 --> 20:15.400
Well,

20:15.750 --> 20:16.680
I understand your personality.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.400
No matter how much I try to persuade you, you won't change your mind.

20:25.350 --> 20:26.440
But I've thought about it.

20:27.090 --> 20:28.130
It's useless to just wait like this

20:28.160 --> 20:29.070
and do nothing.

20:30.000 --> 20:31.920
Ye Xin cast a Soul-Cleansing Charm on Master.

20:32.400 --> 20:33.750
Since he's taken such a measure,

20:34.440 --> 20:36.240
it means that Master, who has lost his memory,

20:36.350 --> 20:37.400
is of use to him.

20:38.260 --> 20:38.930
Last time,

20:38.960 --> 20:40.160
in Uncle Ye Xin's cabin,

20:40.310 --> 20:42.000
I found quite a few old books and notes.

20:42.460 --> 20:44.090
Anyway, there's nowhere else to start looking.

20:44.550 --> 20:45.400
Maybe there will be

20:45.550 --> 20:47.000
some clues and answers in them.

20:48.510 --> 20:51.260
[Prince Ping's residence]

20:59.830 --> 21:00.960
After Prince Zong ascended to the throne,

21:01.120 --> 21:02.450
it seems that due to some agreement

21:02.480 --> 21:03.480
with Mu Qingge,

21:03.600 --> 21:04.990
the family of Prince Ping was spared

21:05.350 --> 21:06.400
from purging or execution.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.350
They only got exiled to the border

21:08.440 --> 21:09.200
and forbidden to return to the capital.

21:10.070 --> 21:11.070
But Prince Ping's family

21:11.200 --> 21:12.440
has been scattered.

21:13.590 --> 21:14.640
The most unfortunate thing is that

21:15.000 --> 21:16.200
Miss Su Xiaoxiao

21:16.350 --> 21:17.450
had already been sent on a mission

21:17.480 --> 21:18.440
by the prince before this.

21:19.240 --> 21:20.200
She met with an accident

21:21.480 --> 21:22.510
and lost her life.

21:26.690 --> 21:28.750
[Be Righteous]

21:44.920 --> 21:46.000
Su Yishui, you traitor,

21:46.840 --> 21:47.970
you actually dared to come

21:48.000 --> 21:48.830
to the capital again?

21:49.200 --> 21:50.070
Madam Battle

21:50.070 --> 21:51.070
will definitely deal with you…

21:51.640 --> 21:52.640
you devil!

21:54.750 --> 21:55.710
You mean Mu Qingge?

21:59.590 --> 22:00.830
If she doesn't come to me,

22:01.350 --> 22:02.550
I'll go to her.

22:09.350 --> 22:10.790
You mere commoners.

22:11.060 --> 22:12.450
I can't be bothered to talk to you.

22:13.750 --> 22:15.030
Go back and tell Mu Qingge

22:15.400 --> 22:16.230
that I'll settle the bill

22:16.590 --> 22:17.680
between her and me in a few days.

22:17.960 --> 22:19.200
Tell her to be well prepared.

22:21.720 --> 22:24.260
[Wester Sect]

22:29.550 --> 22:30.110
Guardian.

22:31.510 --> 22:32.720
G-Guardian,

22:32.740 --> 22:33.820
you're finally back.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.510
Why so flustered?

22:36.800 --> 22:37.670
We...

22:38.110 --> 22:39.510
thought you went to the imperial palace.

22:39.750 --> 22:40.480
Yes.

22:41.160 --> 22:41.840
I wish I could have.

22:42.630 --> 22:43.870
But I took a quick glance.

22:44.400 --> 22:45.110
The imperial palace

22:45.110 --> 22:46.030
was shielded

22:46.050 --> 22:46.730
by a powerful formation.

22:47.550 --> 22:48.340
The person who set up this formation

22:48.370 --> 22:49.890
has cultivation far beyond the Transcendence Realm.

22:50.350 --> 22:52.070
There is no one in the Heavenly Sects with this kind of ability.

22:53.000 --> 22:54.000
The Reborn Mu Qingge

22:54.020 --> 22:55.310
couldn't possibly have gained such power

22:55.310 --> 22:56.160
in such a short time.

22:57.510 --> 22:58.110
So,

22:58.860 --> 22:59.550
it must be Ye Xin

22:59.550 --> 23:00.960
who cast the Soul-Cleansing Charm on me.

23:01.890 --> 23:03.240
Ye Xin really is working with them?

23:04.510 --> 23:05.640
I'd like to see

23:05.880 --> 23:07.130
what the three of them

23:07.160 --> 23:08.240
are up to together.

23:08.770 --> 23:09.210
Go.

23:09.600 --> 23:10.750
Keep a close eye on the capital.

23:11.960 --> 23:12.440
Yes.

23:14.920 --> 23:15.440
Wait.

23:16.920 --> 23:17.830
Where's Xue Ranran?

23:18.880 --> 23:20.110
Why can't I sense the energy of my other half

23:20.110 --> 23:21.310
of the Golden Core in Mount Wester?

23:26.200 --> 23:27.350
Didn't I tell you to keep an eye on her?

23:27.510 --> 23:28.110
Where is she?

23:30.110 --> 23:31.310
We've failed in our duties.

23:31.470 --> 23:32.350
Please punish us, Guardian.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.030
Was it that you couldn't keep an eye on her,

23:34.270 --> 23:35.590
or that you didn't want to?

23:39.830 --> 23:40.240
Forget it.

23:40.810 --> 23:41.410
If it weren't for knowing

23:41.440 --> 23:42.680
that you've been loyal all these years,

23:42.880 --> 23:43.790
I wouldn't let you off so easily.

23:46.110 --> 23:46.920
Anyway, Xue Ranran

23:46.920 --> 23:47.960
carries the energy of my Golden Core.

23:48.440 --> 23:49.400
No matter where she runs,

23:49.550 --> 23:50.510
I can pull her back.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.750
Let her enjoy her freedom for a few days.

23:53.250 --> 23:53.930
After I take care of

23:53.960 --> 23:54.640
the more important thing,

23:54.660 --> 23:55.460
I'll deal with her.

24:25.880 --> 24:26.680
Wasn't this room

24:26.680 --> 24:27.350
rearranged?

24:27.550 --> 24:28.640
Why are these things still here?

24:30.480 --> 24:31.680
Some of these

24:31.680 --> 24:33.070
are things you use regularly,

24:33.250 --> 24:33.930
and some are things

24:33.960 --> 24:34.960
you specially kept.

24:35.190 --> 24:37.030
We didn't dare to handle them carelessly.

24:47.200 --> 24:47.720
What is this?

24:48.680 --> 24:49.480
These

24:49.510 --> 24:51.160
are the cultivation methods you had your disciples copy

24:51.270 --> 24:52.550
as punishment when teaching them in the past.

24:56.320 --> 24:58.260
These years have truly been extremely dull.

24:58.750 --> 24:59.310
Guardian,

24:59.920 --> 25:00.680
actually,

25:00.770 --> 25:02.340
you really were a good master.

25:02.670 --> 25:04.470
You've been dedicated to your disciples.

25:04.760 --> 25:05.650
Those children

25:05.680 --> 25:07.350
were always very respectful to you.

25:08.240 --> 25:10.030
Anyway, Mount Wester is quite large,

25:10.160 --> 25:11.400
and it's rather quiet with few people.

25:12.440 --> 25:13.400
Why don't you

25:14.400 --> 25:15.000
let them come back

25:15.030 --> 25:16.310
once you've gotten used to this role

25:17.490 --> 25:18.580
in a few days?

25:18.790 --> 25:19.750
Get used to what?

25:20.030 --> 25:21.000
I have absolutely no interest

25:21.000 --> 25:21.640
in being a teacher.

25:24.350 --> 25:25.440
Moreover, the cultivation methods here

25:25.510 --> 25:26.440
were copied incorrectly.

25:26.760 --> 25:28.060
[Xue Ranran]

25:26.850 --> 25:27.610
Even if I had taken disciples,

25:27.640 --> 25:28.550
could I have taken someone so foolish?

25:31.030 --> 25:31.750
You're right.

25:33.310 --> 25:33.790
Also,

25:34.440 --> 25:35.750
the reason I stayed here

25:36.000 --> 25:36.680
isn't that I really intend

25:36.680 --> 25:37.440
to settle down.

25:38.000 --> 25:38.920
It's that the strange changes

25:38.920 --> 25:40.070
that happened to me

25:40.400 --> 25:41.590
seem to be related to the Wester Sect.

25:41.960 --> 25:43.160
I need to investigate this thoroughly.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.790
Did you two understand?

25:45.400 --> 25:46.160
Yes.

25:47.880 --> 25:48.440
Alright,

25:48.460 --> 25:49.460
throw all these away.

25:55.440 --> 25:55.960
Wait.

25:57.830 --> 25:58.310
Never mind.

25:59.110 --> 26:00.440
Anyway, there are plenty of these strange things

26:00.790 --> 26:01.640
in the Wester Sect.

26:02.210 --> 26:03.540
Just keep them for now. You can throw them away in the future.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.440
You may leave.

26:05.350 --> 26:05.960
-Yes.
-Yes.

26:25.730 --> 26:26.930
[Xue Ranran]

26:42.420 --> 26:43.760
[Bamboo-Woven Lanternp]

26:44.350 --> 26:46.030
Steps to make lanterns?

26:57.120 --> 26:58.070
My handwriting?

27:04.000 --> 27:05.350
This is indeed written by me.

27:08.960 --> 27:10.030
I must have been crazy.

27:22.750 --> 27:23.590
Xue Ranran?

27:24.110 --> 27:25.000
Xue Ranran.

27:25.240 --> 27:26.750
Xue Ranran, it's all Xue Ranran.

27:29.440 --> 27:30.000
Could it be

27:31.510 --> 27:32.110
that I really…

27:33.220 --> 27:34.910
Since you don't remember,

27:36.160 --> 27:37.960
I'll help you.

27:49.750 --> 27:50.350
That Ye Xin who cast

27:50.350 --> 27:51.480
the Soul-Cleansing Charm on me

27:52.270 --> 27:54.030
must be hoping that I would immediately

27:54.350 --> 27:54.920
retrieve Xue Ranran's Golden Core

27:54.920 --> 27:55.960
and then kill Mu Qingge

27:56.920 --> 27:58.440
after losing my memory Well,

27:59.980 --> 28:01.460
Well, I won't do as he wishes.

28:02.270 --> 28:03.800
I'll fill in the blank space

28:04.510 --> 28:06.200
of the past over ten years

28:06.710 --> 28:07.950
and take back everything I want.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.790
I heard that Su Yishui broke into

28:13.790 --> 28:15.310
the abandoned mansion of Prince Ping today.

28:16.610 --> 28:18.650
Su Yishui, having been affected by the Soul-Cleansing Charm,

28:19.360 --> 28:20.840
has forgotten his unnecessary feelings

28:21.000 --> 28:21.750
and obsessions.

28:22.360 --> 28:24.200
He will eventually be as I wish

28:24.720 --> 28:25.720
and serve my purposes.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.240
So what's next?

28:29.480 --> 28:30.160
Next,

28:30.270 --> 28:32.200
I will have Wei Jiu open Mount Scarlet Flame.

28:32.510 --> 28:33.160
As for you,

28:33.410 --> 28:35.130
all you need to do is use your title as Madam Battle,

28:35.210 --> 28:36.900
the cultivation method I've given you,

28:37.160 --> 28:38.070
and your disciples

28:38.090 --> 28:39.370
you've gathered,

28:39.640 --> 28:40.830
to do one thing for me.

28:41.550 --> 28:42.240
What is it?

28:42.940 --> 28:45.860
Go and trigger a wave of demonic beast transformations everywhere,

28:46.360 --> 28:48.790
then wait for the people from the Heavenly Sects to take the bait.

29:06.550 --> 29:07.270
Only the Blazing Sword

29:07.270 --> 29:08.400
that has been cleansed by the Spirit Spring

29:08.550 --> 29:09.870
can open Mount Scarlet Flame

29:10.070 --> 29:11.480
and restart the gate of the Celestial Sect.

29:11.830 --> 29:12.790
I've been waiting for this day

29:13.070 --> 29:14.240
for a long time.

29:42.690 --> 29:46.050
[Celestial Sect]

30:51.720 --> 30:53.240
Congratulations, My Lord,

30:53.350 --> 30:54.960
for reopening Mount Scarlet Flame

30:55.110 --> 30:56.680
and restarting the Celestial Sect.

30:58.350 --> 30:59.960
With the power of the Celestial Sect,

31:00.400 --> 31:01.550
I will be the only supreme power

31:01.550 --> 31:02.510
among demonic cultivators in the universe.

31:02.790 --> 31:03.480
Soon,

31:03.600 --> 31:04.410
we will revive the era

31:04.440 --> 31:05.510
of the demonic cultivators

31:05.920 --> 31:07.030
and dominate the Heavenly Sects.

31:07.550 --> 31:09.000
Revive the era of the demonic cultivators

31:09.030 --> 31:10.550
and dominate the Heavenly Sects!

31:10.720 --> 31:12.030
Revive the era of the demonic cultivators

31:12.160 --> 31:13.550
and dominate the Heavenly Sects!

31:13.590 --> 31:14.960
Revive the era of the demonic cultivators

31:14.960 --> 31:16.160
and dominate the Heavenly Sects!

31:21.440 --> 31:22.240
The imperial city is protected

31:22.240 --> 31:23.550
by that expert's formation.

31:24.440 --> 31:25.110
The disciples I took in

31:25.110 --> 31:26.200
from the Wester Sect in the past

31:26.220 --> 31:27.420
are of no use now.

31:27.920 --> 31:28.880
I've already driven them away.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.480
The military affairs around the capital

31:31.750 --> 31:32.720
are firmly controlled

31:32.750 --> 31:34.270
by Su Yu's trusted and loyal subordinates,

31:35.720 --> 31:37.000
and the defense is airtight.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.880
It's impossible

31:38.880 --> 31:39.720
to stir up any trouble nearby.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.000
Unless...

31:43.510 --> 31:44.790
Most of the generals who were following me back then

31:45.240 --> 31:46.590
were exiled to guard the borders.

31:47.350 --> 31:49.980
[Map of Great Qi]

31:54.960 --> 31:56.110
20 years have passed,

31:57.040 --> 31:57.930
and I'm sure there's been

31:57.960 --> 31:59.000
many rounds of rise and fall in the court,

31:59.480 --> 32:00.440
with countless battles fought.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.790
Meanwhile, those who have stayed far from the court

32:03.080 --> 32:04.450
have preserved their strength

32:05.200 --> 32:06.400
and become people I can rely on.

32:13.350 --> 32:13.790
Guardian,

32:13.810 --> 32:14.660
the meal is ready.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.000
After being in seclusion for over a decade,

32:23.440 --> 32:24.240
I still haven't reached

32:24.270 --> 32:25.030
the state of inedia

32:25.510 --> 32:26.920
and have to rely on these mundane things to stave off my hunger.

32:27.590 --> 32:28.960
Guardian, you used to eat every meal

32:29.030 --> 32:29.680
without missing one.

32:29.960 --> 32:31.110
Sometimes you even had extra meals at night.

32:31.270 --> 32:31.720
Enough.

32:32.350 --> 32:33.440
Mundane things are considered taboo

32:33.440 --> 32:34.160
and are not conducive to cultivation.

32:34.480 --> 32:35.280
Put it down and leave.

32:35.720 --> 32:36.070
Yes.

32:36.510 --> 32:36.960
Yes.

32:47.510 --> 32:48.880
Time changes,

32:49.070 --> 32:50.160
and people's hearts are fickle.

32:51.440 --> 32:52.790
I need to find a way to gather the ambitions

32:52.790 --> 32:53.920
of these scattered generals.

32:56.310 --> 32:57.350
The freshness of that fish?

32:57.720 --> 32:58.400
It seems to have been steamed

32:58.400 --> 32:59.720
with the unique lotus leaves from Mount Wester.

33:03.110 --> 33:05.160
The vegetables were soaked in the morning dew from 6 AM.

33:07.070 --> 33:08.030
Just one meal

33:08.030 --> 33:09.070
can disturb my heart.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.790
Who knows how decadent

33:11.030 --> 33:12.440
and absurd I've been all these years?

33:29.350 --> 33:31.030
Right now, I need to fight with the mundane world,

33:31.680 --> 33:32.790
so I can eat these common things.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.720
Once these matters are settled,

33:34.720 --> 33:35.750
I can resume inedia.

33:36.550 --> 33:37.550
Guardian, you are right.

33:38.310 --> 33:39.480
The dish is beautifully cooked.

33:39.830 --> 33:41.000
Next time, bring more.

33:41.440 --> 33:41.960
Yes.

33:42.400 --> 33:43.270
Yes.

33:43.980 --> 33:45.780
Indeed, with a full stomach, my thoughts are clearer.

33:46.360 --> 33:47.080
I already have

33:47.110 --> 33:47.960
a rough plan in mind.

34:01.610 --> 34:02.810
What should we do?

34:03.110 --> 34:03.750
Guardian's appetite

34:03.750 --> 34:04.790
has long been spoiled by Ranran.

34:05.360 --> 34:06.280
The dishes Ranran made

34:06.310 --> 34:07.160
are already finished.

34:08.510 --> 34:09.480
I can't possibly recreate

34:09.480 --> 34:10.230
that flavor.

34:11.670 --> 34:12.230
I've got it.

34:12.480 --> 34:14.070
Ranran left her recipes in the kitchen.

34:14.590 --> 34:16.190
We can always follow the recipes, right?

34:18.230 --> 34:19.550
As expected of my sister.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.110
Let's go.

34:24.510 --> 34:26.630
Four slices of ginger,

34:28.840 --> 34:29.710
a small pinch of chopped green onions...

34:30.360 --> 34:31.360
Just a small pinch.

34:40.510 --> 34:41.400
I carefully recalled

34:41.400 --> 34:42.590
every move Ranran made while cooking.

34:42.920 --> 34:44.070
I even mimicked the rhythm

34:44.150 --> 34:45.510
with which she stirred things.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.110
Try it.

34:49.710 --> 34:51.150
How is it? Does it taste similar?

34:54.730 --> 34:55.810
You might as well feed it to the dogs.

34:57.500 --> 34:58.950
You had these skills at noon, but forgot them by the evening?

35:02.130 --> 35:03.300
What are you waiting for? Redo it.

35:03.670 --> 35:04.110
Yes.

35:04.290 --> 35:04.730
Yes.

35:11.040 --> 35:12.890
I didn't sleep all night, and it still turned out like this.

35:13.540 --> 35:15.310
I really am not cut out for this.

35:26.070 --> 35:27.510
If you want to kill me, just tell me.

35:28.110 --> 35:29.440
No need to be so vicious.

35:29.880 --> 35:30.920
Guardian, even if you think

35:30.920 --> 35:32.110
my cooking skills are not as good as Ranran's,

35:32.320 --> 35:33.840
there's no need to say such hurtful things.

35:34.280 --> 35:36.070
Yu Chen and I have always been poor cooks.

35:36.150 --> 35:37.190
You know that.

35:39.190 --> 35:39.960
Besides,

35:40.230 --> 35:41.230
since Ranran came here,

35:41.670 --> 35:43.030
you've only eaten the meals she made.

35:43.710 --> 35:45.150
In the past, I only ate the meals she made?

35:47.150 --> 35:48.000
This Xue Ranran

35:48.450 --> 35:49.160
must have secretly

35:49.190 --> 35:50.000
cast some kind of spell on me.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.360
Even the meal you liked yesterday

35:52.590 --> 35:53.400
was made by Ranran

35:53.420 --> 35:54.450
before she left.

35:55.030 --> 35:56.000
She was worried that after she left,

35:56.030 --> 35:56.630
you wouldn't be used

35:56.650 --> 35:57.530
to the meals we made,

35:57.710 --> 35:58.800
so she had us learn to cook like she does.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.400
But we've already done our best to replicate it.

36:02.070 --> 36:03.150
We didn't expect that cooking

36:03.360 --> 36:04.440
is even harder than cultivating.

36:05.840 --> 36:06.840
If I had known it was made by her,

36:07.000 --> 36:08.110
I wouldn't have touched that dish at all.

36:08.930 --> 36:09.640
In this life, Mu Ranwu

36:09.670 --> 36:10.550
is actually like Mu Qingge—

36:10.570 --> 36:11.460
fond of cooking.

36:11.760 --> 36:12.590
How much of my time

36:12.840 --> 36:14.000
have these two sisters wasted?

36:14.960 --> 36:15.630
Oh, Guardian,

36:16.330 --> 36:16.970
there's news

36:17.000 --> 36:18.230
about Mu Qingge, whom you ordered us

36:18.400 --> 36:19.030
to keep an eye on before.

36:26.920 --> 36:27.630
Strange.

36:28.230 --> 36:29.800
Why doesn't the energy of my Golden Core

36:30.190 --> 36:31.590
feel strong inside Mu Qingge?

36:32.920 --> 36:34.230
Could it be that this half of my Golden Core

36:34.800 --> 36:35.590
has all been absorbed

36:35.630 --> 36:36.670
by that fruit, Xue Ranran?

36:37.630 --> 36:38.150
Sovereign,

36:38.510 --> 36:40.000
it's said that she established a sect last month.

36:40.400 --> 36:41.280
In just over a month,

36:41.360 --> 36:42.440
she has already gathered many followers,

36:42.920 --> 36:44.000
including some experts

36:44.030 --> 36:45.230
who have already had their cores formed.

36:46.000 --> 36:47.360
You're being quite high-profile here.

36:47.800 --> 36:48.840
All her disciples say that

36:49.000 --> 36:49.800
cultivating under her guidance

36:49.830 --> 36:50.790
leads to rapid advancement,

36:51.150 --> 36:52.150
with tremendous progress every day.

37:09.320 --> 37:11.110
The spiritual power of the light formation in front of her is extremely strong.

37:11.540 --> 37:12.880
It's from the same powerful cultivator who created

37:12.880 --> 37:14.190
the formation protecting the imperial city.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.440
I'm afraid it's that Ye Xin again.

37:17.480 --> 37:18.670
This person is unfathomable.

37:18.840 --> 37:20.230
His strength is far beyond mine.

37:20.880 --> 37:21.800
We must not act recklessly.

37:23.550 --> 37:24.800
Keep a close watch on Mu Qingge.

37:25.510 --> 37:26.550
She must be scheming something

37:26.710 --> 37:27.590
by recruiting disciples widely.

37:28.070 --> 37:29.710
Once I break the formation of that expert,

37:30.150 --> 37:31.190
I'll deal with her.

37:31.840 --> 37:32.470
-Yes.
-Yes.

37:35.440 --> 37:37.110
She did remind me of one thing though.

37:38.000 --> 37:39.070
To get revenge,

37:39.440 --> 37:40.280
the Wester Sect

37:40.280 --> 37:41.550
indeed needs some manpower.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.150
Yu Tong, Yu Chen,

37:43.360 --> 37:44.230
pass on my orders.

37:45.190 --> 37:45.920
-Yes.
-Yes.

37:54.670 --> 37:55.510
Master is actually

37:55.590 --> 37:57.320
taking in disciples again.

37:58.360 --> 37:59.070
Does this mean we have a chance

37:59.070 --> 38:00.150
to return to the Wester Sect?

38:01.230 --> 38:01.840
No, that's not right.

38:02.600 --> 38:04.330
When Master drove us down the mountain,

38:04.360 --> 38:06.000
he said he had no intention of taking in disciples in this life.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.920
He even said taking us in was a mistake.

38:08.590 --> 38:09.710
It's only been a few days.

38:10.440 --> 38:12.070
Why has he started taking in disciples again?

38:13.680 --> 38:14.930
Perhaps these past few days,

38:14.960 --> 38:15.880
he's been bored,

38:15.970 --> 38:16.890
realizing that

38:16.920 --> 38:17.880
he's lonely without us.

38:19.840 --> 38:20.190
Let's go.

38:20.280 --> 38:21.110
When are we going up the mountain?

38:25.070 --> 38:26.000
To be honest,

38:26.230 --> 38:27.510
this time, the Guardian's requirements

38:28.030 --> 38:29.630
for disciples' spiritual power and cultivation

38:29.670 --> 38:30.710
are much higher than before.

38:31.070 --> 38:33.030
Given the current qualifications of the three of you,

38:33.880 --> 38:34.630
I'm afraid…

38:41.510 --> 38:42.630
But spiritual power isn't the only factor

38:42.630 --> 38:43.440
the Guardian considers.

38:45.070 --> 38:46.360
He reserved one spot

38:46.480 --> 38:47.320
for special consideration.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.550
What spot? Just tell us.

38:50.150 --> 38:51.510
It's for people who can make food that suits the Guardian's taste.

38:53.550 --> 38:54.110
We're doomed.

38:56.000 --> 38:57.710
Now we have no chance at all.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.840
Looks like we'll never be able to

39:00.000 --> 39:01.440
return to the Wester Sect in this lifetime.

39:10.630 --> 39:11.000
Get out!

39:13.110 --> 39:14.480
You actually dare to call yourselves master chefs?

39:14.670 --> 39:15.400
None of you can cook!

39:16.030 --> 39:16.550
Keep looking!

39:17.320 --> 39:18.150
-Yes.
-Yes.

39:25.670 --> 39:26.840
Soul-Cleansing Charm?

39:28.120 --> 39:28.930
Maybe I can find it

39:28.960 --> 39:29.710
in the Omnipotent Talismans Manual.

39:36.320 --> 39:38.400
It's in the talisman section, third row.

39:44.710 --> 39:45.400
Why is this Xue Ranran

39:45.400 --> 39:46.070
everywhere?

39:46.320 --> 39:47.440
It's like being hunted.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.110
Why is there no record

40:06.110 --> 40:07.150
of the Soul-Cleansing Charm anywhere?

40:07.920 --> 40:08.920
This Ye Xin.

40:14.800 --> 40:15.710
Collection of Entertainment?

40:17.000 --> 40:18.360
The book written by Mu Qingge?

40:19.270 --> 40:20.910
I heard she's an expert in enjoying life.

40:21.360 --> 40:22.670
I'd like to see what she wrote.

40:32.880 --> 40:33.510
Boring.

40:35.230 --> 40:36.360
Chapter of Fierce Beasts?

40:42.840 --> 40:43.590
This Mu Qingge

40:43.590 --> 40:44.920
actually dared to write about me this way?

40:56.360 --> 40:57.440
In comparison, Xue Ranran seems

40:57.460 --> 40:58.380
more reliable.

41:06.000 --> 41:06.710
Pig's blood?

41:07.630 --> 41:09.030
When have I ever eaten such filth?

41:10.190 --> 41:11.630
Anti-aging and anti-decline?

41:12.280 --> 41:13.030
Ridiculous.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.440
Why would I need that?

41:19.920 --> 41:21.320
This one is not bad though.

41:21.620 --> 41:25.500
[Puxin Village]

41:40.410 --> 41:41.410
Wish you all the best.

41:42.800 --> 41:43.630
Great.

41:44.150 --> 41:45.670
After the Nine-Headed Kui'ao was eliminated,

41:46.000 --> 41:47.840
the village has finally regained its vitality.

42:12.960 --> 42:14.400
Master mentioned before

42:14.880 --> 42:16.880
that Uncle Ye Xin looked familiar.

42:17.510 --> 42:18.070
Could they have met

42:18.070 --> 42:19.190
a long time ago?

42:25.630 --> 42:27.400
Is it me and Mu Ranwu from back then?

42:29.280 --> 42:30.030
They don't look like us.

42:31.030 --> 42:31.920
So who could they be?

42:33.320 --> 42:35.320
There are too many mysteries surrounding Uncle Ye Xin.

42:35.920 --> 42:36.960
Who is he really?

42:37.840 --> 42:39.070
And why did he adopt us?

42:42.110 --> 42:43.710
The answer is probably in this portrait.

43:06.800 --> 43:07.510
Found it.

43:13.150 --> 43:14.480
So, the Soul-Cleansing Charm

43:15.140 --> 43:16.710
is unbreakable.

43:18.150 --> 43:19.280
But if the person who was cast with it

43:19.590 --> 43:20.480
falls in love again

43:20.480 --> 43:21.440
with their forgotten lover,

43:22.480 --> 43:24.150
they will naturally remember everything.
